      "content": "Wait, I think you cut off at the end there. Also, i'm a bit confused by the analogies you used. Why are you using goblins to explain structural mechanics? I'm just trying to understand the actual physics of the stress distribution between the two materials for my exam. Can you explain the bond between the steel and concrete without the metaphors?",
